# Postmodernism and the cone. Frames only, no record. The checks are existing scripts; the identifications are readings.
check "python3 -I physics/time/check.py"
check "python3 -I philosophy/cone.py"
kripke S5w = all 3 reflexive+transitive+symmetric
claim valid S5w "p -> []<>p"
frame "Postmodern-safe (physics/time/BASE.md section 5; frames_time.ath)" reading "a formula is postmodern-safe when it is valid on every frame of a stated class; physics/time/check.py computes the table on all S4 and S5 frames on 1..3 worlds" -> 2 label checked-finite reach 3 cost 40
frame "S5 = no privileged world" reading "on every S5 frame on 3 worlds p -> []<>p (axiom B) is valid: every world a world sees sees it back, so no world stands above another" -> 5 label checked-finite reach 3 cost 40
frame "A hub that is not critical (philosophy/cone.py facts 1 and 4)" reading "the hub of a cone is critical exactly when its base is disconnected, and the fewest lateral links that free it are the pieces minus one; every base graph on up to 6 vertices" -> 3 label checked-finite reach 3 cost 40
frame "A free hub is not yet a disk (philosophy/cone.py fact 3; philosophy/PSYCHOSIS.md section 5)" reading "the cone is a disk exactly when the base is one path or one cycle, and the hub is inside only for a cycle; a connected base frees the hub but gives a disk only in those two cases; every base graph on up to 6 vertices" -> 3 label checked-finite reach 3 cost 40
frame "History-independent = postmodern-safe on the S5 cluster" reading "a candidate with no shared fact computed from both sides; see core/ontology/joins/cosmos_time.ath; open" -> none label open reach 2 cost 80
frame "Lyotard, La Condition postmoderne 1979, incredulity toward metanarratives (cited from memory)" reading "ANALOGY (a reading): no metanarrative read as no privileged world (S5), and no privileged world read as a hub that is not critical, or further as the disk. The S5 and cone facts above are checked; the identifications are not" -> none label open reach 3 cost 80
frame "Addison: we are underselling postmodernism; if it can so much as touch the upper disk, a lot of things may refactor very clean" reading "ANALOGY (a reading): the joins in core/ontology/joins/ are lateral links under the hub. None of them frees the hub or makes a disk; their effect on the pieces is measured in core/ontology/SOCIOLOGY.md. That the refactor is clean is not checked" -> none label open reach 3 cost 80
